***conformance tests***

# inflected-swelling
With the token of `pat-03`, `POST /chat` with `text` "Noga mi je otekla" returns `type` `GUIDANCE` with a non-empty `watchFor`.

# driving-topic
With the token of `pat-07`, `POST /chat` with `text` "Kdaj bom lahko spet vozil avto?" returns `type` `GUIDANCE`.
